            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/instagram/post",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["instagram", "post"]
            },
            "description": "Executes the full pipeline for the top unprocessed trend:\n1. Groq generates post copywriting (headline, slide content, caption, hashtags)\n2. Canvas Image Composer builds branded 1080x1350 card with layout & visual accents\n3. Meta Graph API creates Instagram media container and publishes post."
          },
